aption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454690118668288895014.jpeg/shPm8dpflxaJklGz-CElDvBHGijMtALfVAsTnlQLE54\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454692635381760709481.jpeg/ZKV250x7Ml0bh9Ac12Z08bgrqPWOvuuzHJQIrhyUCK4\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454682350424064157208.jpeg/HIJu_N4vppWwgTrtA3YEF3b_ibtu8U_8Je84JyXvOCc\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454684640645120508631.jpeg/fLCLljIRoj5wc0HU_n41bJVPHnv8tYR5JEPytyRD8rc\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454686972809216327469.jpeg/R1IQ3kg4CIcwG6z39Vfa-aAihKstvCeiKop31yqKd9c\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454689174949888593084.jpeg/R0Foc5_nglXYAKuJxBlOVHrhEQk-r98qiio30ooqN9I\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454691247067136538274.jpeg/o4AgnH8S-1pJ6zI9mX1x_7fz9RdHcYq7I3761SN--tU\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260519/1133454673764683776017563.jpeg/81fTjRkO6XGFpwPRKmXqfTpAJvNYXiKIo5Dny6OQ58s\" alt=\"李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）\"><figcaption>李多慧透露肩膀出狀況，經求診後被醫生診斷為韌帶發炎。（Facebook/李多慧）</figcaption></figure><p>經檢查後，醫生隨即向李多慧指出「現在就是這條韌帶發炎」，證實這正是導致她肩膀疼痛的主因。由於發炎情況明顯，醫生先問她「怕不怕打針？」試圖緩解她當下的緊張。</p><p>面對醫生提問，李多慧承認自己怕打針，醫生隨即語重心長地對她說「可是妳還是要打啊，不然妳沒辦法跳舞」。最後她順利完成打針療程，影片曝光後立刻湧入大批網友留言關心。</p><p>相關閱讀：李多慧確定續約當小龍女啦啦隊隊長　IG曬火辣泳裝照秒吸20萬Like</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260212/1098680177308733440603598.jpeg/Cie4BstVDTVf2wDigyP-57ilBulK7b6Dw8A-s8PAPrM\" alt=\"李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）\"><figcaption>李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260212/1098680179900944384269501.jpeg/DPHTK389j0MsLt1d3aiV0SkE-VxcMODrlsTppJbE6aQ\" alt=\"李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）\"><figcaption>李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260212/1098680182379909120057816.jpeg/K10S5iVOJjPn-6h9qGSSWF5DSCi4R_lamjasr5o2rK8\" alt=\"李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）\"><figcaption>李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260212/1098680184787570688138594.jpeg/gxPf2IkZrwLcvXX1e7vV5JTBVyShsuafOJv3pjib96Y\" alt=\"李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）\"><figcaption>李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260212/1098680187174260736714523.jpeg/ieC4fLrjj0gjnt2Gz2xvSwV__EMS2Fi-wPgzJcD4MyU\" alt=\"李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）\"><figcaption>李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260212/1098680176214020096156230.jpeg/Z_RFlbGWQQ4xhCfFfB6xpLFrkCQzMQB30mckK9JnJCs\" alt=\"李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）\"><figcaption>李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260212/1098680178848174080143096.jpeg/KbcoAMoyvnPCjb1a-pJTmdTrsxtl0t3HJgyGyiYMhso\" alt=\"李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）\"><figcaption>李多慧曬泳裝照（Instagram@le_dahye）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「引新聞」授權轉載】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-20T05:55:11.466264+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1521,"images":29,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}